2026-06-03 Starting with a simple internet idea in 1996, iHerb has grown into a health and wellness hub covering 185 countries and regions worldwide, spanning 29 years. Over the past 29 years, the platform has built the trust of more than 11 million active users through its commitment to genuine products and control over the supply chain. iHerb recently announced the launch of its "618 Peak Shopping Festival" and introduced a series of measures in Hong Kong and Southeast Asia, including limited-time discounts, exclusive offers for new users, and local express delivery, to further lower the barrier to accessing high-quality health products. Unlike traditional cross-border e-commerce, which involves multiple intermediaries, iHerb directly purchases goods from brands, ships them to its own warehouse, and then delivers them to consumers intact. This direct sourcing and delivery model not only eliminates the possibility of third-party adulteration but also makes prices more transparent and fair. Previously, many consumers in Hong Kong, Southeast Asia and other regions who wanted to buy high-quality dietary supplements, sports nutrition products or natural beauty and personal care products from Europe and the United States often faced many troubles such as high shipping costs, slow delivery, and difficulty in distinguishing between genuine and fake products. The emergence of iHerb has helped solve these problems. The platform currently boasts nearly 3,000 brands and over 50,000 health and wellness products, ranging from common vitamins and probiotics to niche sports energy supplements and children's nutritional gummies that mothers can trust, covering almost all scenarios of family health management. Gut health management: coping with the stress of a fast-paced lifestyle Office workers frequently eat out and experience high stress levels, making their gut health a major concern. iHerb selects "California Gold Nutrition LactoBif® 30 Probiotics (CGN00965)," each containing 30 billion CFU and 8 types of probiotics. The individually sealed double-layer aluminum foil blister pack is convenient to carry and helps maintain the balance of gut flora. Quality sleep and relaxation: enhancing nighttime repair capabilities Addressing the concerns of many regarding sleep quality and muscle relaxation, "Doctor's Best High Absorption Magnesium (DRB00087)" utilizes Albion® TRAACS® chelation technology for high absorption. Each serving provides 200 mg of magnesium to help support normal nerve and muscle relaxation functions, while being gentle and non-irritating to the stomach. Beauty Nutrition: Supports Radiance from Within External stress and irregular sleep patterns can easily affect the condition of hair, skin, and nails. "Nature's Way Alive! Hair, Skin and Nails Gummies (NWY11534)" are strawberry-flavored gummies. Each set of 2 gummies contains 2,500 micrograms of bioactive vitamins and 100 milligrams of collagen, along with added vitamins C and E to help support shiny hair, strong nails, and healthy skin. Cardiovascular and Cellular Vitality: Energizing the Body
