Additionally, “ProHealth Longevity, NMN Pro 1000 (PHV77904)” supports cellular energy production and vitality, designed specifically for adults focused on healthy aging and overall well-being. Each capsule provides 1,000 mg of NMN, making it ideal for consumers with a regular wellness routine. To celebrate the 618 Shopping Festival , iHerb is offering the following benefits to users in Hong Kong and across Southeast Asia:
1. New User Exclusive: Use promo code 【WELCOME7】 on your first order to enjoy 30% off;
2. 618 Peak Shopping Festival: From June 11 to 20, use 【618SALE26】 to enjoy 27% off sitewide; limited to two uses per person;
3. Monthly Discount: From now until the end of June, use code 【6HK75】 to enjoy 25% off your entire order. Limited to two uses per person for both new and existing users, except for special products;
4. Free shipping on orders over 150 HKD in Hong Kong, with same-day or next-day express delivery. Scan the QR code on the poster to download the app and learn more. Authenticity is iHerb’s promise. Every bottle of supplements and every tube of skincare lotion is shipped directly from the brand’s production lines to iHerb’s warehouses worldwide, with no outsourcing or intermediaries involved. Customers can log in and browse at any time via the official website or app, and the entire ordering process is clear and seamless. The payment process supports Hong Kong dollars, and a variety of payment methods—including credit cards and e-wallets—are accepted.
For new users who haven’t registered yet, now is the perfect time. Whether you’re a fitness enthusiast, a working professional focused on daily self-care, or a parent looking for safe and nutritious products for your children, you can register in just a few minutes on your phone or computer and purchase globally acclaimed products at incredibly affordable prices. With 29 years of dedication, iHerb has proven that quality health products should not be hindered by distance or distribution channels. Visit the official website or scan the QR code to download the app, and you’ll find that shopping on iHerb is much simpler than you imagined. Promotions won’t wait—why not take advantage of this 618 shopping festival to treat yourself and your family to a worry-free, healthy shopping experience?
